# Defection — NineIron pulls a small breakaway group (up to six)
# into a maintenance locker. The Playwright cherry-picks: usually
# four chatters and two mods, or two of each plus two neutrals.
# This is the act-break.

== defection
  cast: NineIron
  setting: NineIronHide

<broadcast: cohort(Defectors)>
  NARRATOR
    The walls in here are not stickered. The fans are not on full.
    There is one chair and it is occupied.

NINEIRON
  (improv duration: 180s, advance on: quorum(4) [speech(motherboard), gesture(nod)])
  (Sit. Show the rebar arm. Tell the truth: there's no chatter-mod
   war. There's a Motherboard. You were a Cyborg for six months.
   Take questions; do not flinch from the weird ones. Let the
   audience drag the truth out of you in their own order — the
   advance signal is when four people say the word "Motherboard"
   without you saying it first.)

<set: NineIron.knows.motherboard_named = true>
<set: Motherboard.knows.revealed = true>

# Once the defectors know, the broadcast bridges them back to the
# leaders. The Playwright cues Vex / Praxis to react over the relay.
<broadcast: cohort(Chatters)>
  NINEIRON
    (over the relay, to anyone still in the Chatter Camp)
    Vex. Listen to me. The mods are not the enemy. Bring them in.

<broadcast: cohort(Mods)>
  NINEIRON
    (over the relay, to anyone still at the Outpost)
    Praxis. The chatters aren't lying. Meet at the fountain.

* The defectors choose: storm the Core.
  -> storm_core
* The defectors choose: unite the factions in the Plaza.
  -> unite
* The defectors choose: scatter and live to fight another night.
  -> scatter

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Failure mode — Chatters and Mods collide before NineIron can
# intervene. The Cyborgs come out on top by default.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

== faction_war
  cast: Vex, Praxis
  setting: Plaza

<broadcast: location(Plaza)>
  NARRATOR
    The cohorts meet at the fountain. The fountain is, as ever, dry.

VEX | PRAXIS
  (improv duration: 90s, advance on: any [gesture(strike), speech(stop)])
  (Have at it. Shout each other down. Let audience members on each
   side actually argue. The Playwright is waiting for the Cyborg
   performers to file in silently from the door — when the room
   notices them, advance.)

<broadcast: location(Plaza)>
  NARRATOR
    Eight figures walk out of the door behind the fountain. They are
    in step. They are looking at no one in particular and at
    everyone in general.

CYBORG
  (improv duration: 60s, advance on: quorum(8) [gesture(still)])
  (One cyborg per faction-member up front. Approach. Touch a
   shoulder. The audience-member they touch is, with their consent,
   removed from their faction cohort and enrolled into Cyborgs.)

<enroll: cohort(Cyborgs)>

-> ending_assimilated
